OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be mainly dry and
OL,6,Fbright with some sunny spells, perhaps
OL,7,Fpatchy rain or showers developing over
OL,8,Fsouthern Aberdeenshire in the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Winds mostly light.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FOutbreaks of rain will push
OL,12,Fnorthwards during the evening, heavy
OL,13,Fat times. Drier and clearer conditions
OL,14,Freturning from the west around dawn.
OL,15,FBreezy around the coast.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FBright spells and showers,
OL,18,Fthe showers mainly through the
OL,19,Fafternoon and early evening with the
OL,20,Fbest of the sunshine during the
OL,21,Fmorning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
